    shares of common stock issuable upon exercise of outstanding common stock options issued to members of management, consultants, and
    directors at a weighted average exercise price of $18.97 per common share.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
